/**
 * Shared `GET /api/projects/status/events` stream (server `apps/server/src/projects`).
 *
 * The server pushes one `data: status` per project/agent status change. Screens that want fresh data
 * share a single `EventSource`: the sidebar tree (`app-sidebar.svelte`) and the `/projects` workflow
 * (`+page.svelte`) both subscribe here, so one connection serves both and it closes with the last
 * subscriber. A burst of events costs one refetch (trailing window), and a dropped stream reconnects
 * with exponential backoff. Every caller keeps its own poll as a fallback and asks `isOpen()` for the
 * delay: slower while the stream carries the changes.
 *
